OL,3,GNEWSAFine Gael proposes unity forum to
OL,4,Aconsider Ireland's constitutional
OL,5,Afuture
OL,6,
OL,7,FFine Gael has proposed appointing a
OL,8,Fjunior minister in the Irish government
OL,9,Ffor "north south relations" as well as
OL,10,Festablishing a forum on Irish unity.
OL,12,FThe plans come as part of the party's
OL,13,Flong awaited "blueprint" on Irish
OL,14,Funity, which was published at Fine
OL,15,FGael's ard fheis (party conference) in
OL,16,FCork on Saturday.
OL,18,FIt comes just days after Taoiseach
OL,19,F(Irish prime minister) Micheal Martin,
OL,20,Fthe leader of Fianna Fail, put forward
OL,21,Fhis own proposals on Irish unity to his
OL,22,Fparliamentary party.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
